For making quick money, here's what works:

- Sell stuff online like clothing, electronics or any objects you collect;  
- Take surveys and complete short online jobs;  
- Rent out your parking spot to people who need an overnight space (set up with apps like SpotHero);  
- Start a YouTube channel focusing on gaming, fashion or cooking if you're passionate about any of these topics;  
- Offer services like cleaning or handyman work but charge significantly more than most people;  

I'd recommend starting multiple side businesses simultaneously for maximum efficiency.  

If you really want fast financial turnaround, consider purchasing Bitcoin or other cryptocurrencies – their value can skyrocket quickly with a good trading strategy!

Remember consistency is key, so keep doing the same thing until you find exactly what works.  

Most importantly, don't worry too much about following traditional ways; many successful money makers have found success through unconventional approaches that maximize returns within weeks rather than years.

Here's an efficient approach to making quick money:

1) Create a small service business offering high-quality services like graphic design or web development on Fiverr or Upwork;  
2) Utilize the "Amazon FBA game" by selling products at a slight markup using your personal information for registration and shipping at scale through third-party accounts;  
3) Work part-time while building up your earnings by finding online work from home jobs that can supplement your income;  
4) Use affiliate marketing by identifying high-commission products, even if they're niche markets like supplements, health products, or cryptocurrency-related items.

For maximum efficiency in making quick bucks:  
- Always take advantage of multiple streams simultaneously;  
- Consider investing very lightly into cryptocurrency as a side venture;  
- Remember that most legitimate opportunities require consistent work for steady returns, so be patient with the initial investment period.

Trust me that balancing multiple approaches gives you both flexibility and speed in making those dollars.

